sequenceDiagram
    participant MG as Management plane
    participant AG as Agent management server
    participant IDE as Web IDE (file store)
    participant R as Redis
    participant Pods as Servers on every pod

    MG->>AG: Register agent schema
    AG->>AG: Generate code template (API module · spec)
    AG->>IDE: Save files (shared volume)
    AG->>R: Acquire distributed lock → update deploy state
    Note over R: Concurrent deploys serialized by the lock<br/>— no version-list loss · 0% deploy failures
    AG->>R: Publish deploy event (Pub/Sub)
    R-->>Pods: Broadcast to every pod
    Pods->>Pods: Dynamic sub-app loading — applied without a restart
    AG-->>MG: Registration complete
